      "content": "it's just hard to see it that way when looking at the math of it. like, if i'm the one carrying all this baggage and it just keeps spilling over onto them... wouldn't it be more selfless to just let the line end here? if i'm gone, they don't have to deal with my mess anymore. it feels almost like a mercy, you know? to just stop the cycle before i break something else.",
